event: content_block_delta
data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/plan-note.md\", \"content\": \"# Plan for mission m1 (greet, tested)\\n\\nMission criteria (all three required for campaign-met):\\n1. src/greet.py defines greet(name) returning \\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"\\n2. tests/test_greet.py covers a normal name and the empty string\\n3. `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exits 0\\n\\nPlan:\\n- Dispatch full spec to dev in one message (dev cannot ask follow-up questions).\\n- Wait for dev's reply.\\n- Judge by fetching dev's branch, not trusting the report: read src/greet.py,\\n  read tests/test_greet.py, and independently run\\n  `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` against the fetched tree.\\n- If any criterion is unmet, send precise rework describing exactly what's wrong.\\n- On acceptance, merge/bring the commit onto my own branch and commit it there\\n  (my branch is the only thing that survives), write a durable report to the\\n  output directory, then reply to m1 with outcome campaign-met.\\n- Deadline 2026-11-02T09:12:29Z; this is a small mission — if it stalls after\\n  reasonable rework attempts, reply honestly with campaign-converged or\\n  campaign-exhausted rather than looping indefinitely.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

